WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Elevate Your Smoke. Nine minutes a day. A thirty-day challenge.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.600
Push for strength — press power you can trust.

00:05.600 --> 00:08.200
Squat for power — legs that carry the mission.

00:08.200 --> 00:10.800
Plank for core armor — hold when it counts.

00:10.800 --> 00:13.400
Pull for standard — own your bodyweight.

00:13.400 --> 00:16.000
Conditioning — thirty days. Nine minutes. No gym.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.600
Pace and grit — transform starts when you lock in.

00:18.600 --> 00:21.200
By August 15, show up sharper.

00:21.200 --> 00:24.500
Lock your callsign. Elevate your smoke.
